      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help with my smart home setup. my ecobee and hue lights have been acting really weird lately. like, the temp drops to exactly 66 at like 3am every other night, and the lights in the living room keep turning a dim amber color for no reason. i thought it was a bug but the timing is so specific it feels like someone is messin with my account. i think my ex might have set something up before we split. can you help me figure out if this is actually someone accessing my system?",
